  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UKRI COVID-19 Grant Extension Allocation (CoA) provided organisations with resources to sustain UKRI grant-funded research during the period of pandemic disruption and its immediate aftermath. Some of the funding was directly used supporting the following ODA-eligible grants at University of Bristol: AH/T007842/1; 
ES/T002646/1; 
NE/S009000/1; 
BB/S018840/1; 
EP/P028233/1; 
EP/P028233/1; 
EP/T015462/1; 
NE/R017980/1.</narrative>
  </description>
